# GM-19.1 room lifecycle. Use the isolated synthetic fixture for positive rows.
# The examples use PostgREST's JSON object body and the real GM-07 transport shape.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54331
@publicKey = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PUBLIC_KEY
@hostToken = REPLACE_WITH_GM16_ACCESS_TOKEN
@memberToken = REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_GM16_ACCESS_TOKEN
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_ROOM_UUID
@anchorId = REPLACE_WITH_SYNTHETIC_PUBLISHED_ANCHOR_UUID
@desiredAt = REPLACE_WITH_FUTURE_ISO_UTC
@roomCode = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_ROOM_CODE
@version = REPLACE_WITH_LATEST_VERSION

# Run the sequential Bruno collection for automatic variable capture/assertions.
# These manual examples require updating version after every successful write.

### Create room: host becomes the first member and the room starts in LOBBY.
# Expect 200 {ok:true,state:LOBBY,roomId,version,data:{expiresAt}}.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/create_room
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"19000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","display_name":"GM19 host","anchor_id":"{{anchorId}}","radius_m":1500,"desired_at":"{{desiredAt}}","service_mode":"dine_in","meal_slot":"dinner","time_hint":null,"budget":null,"avoid_recent":false}

### Snapshot: shared room fields plus caller-owned preferences/votes/submission only.
# Expect 200 {ok:true,data:{roomId,state,version,context,members,pool,ownPreferences}}.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_room_snapshot
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"room_id":"{{roomId}}"}

### Invalid input: malformed code is a stable 400-domain error envelope.
# Expect HTTP400 and messageKey=INVALID_INPUT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/join_room
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"19000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","code":"bad","display_name":"x"}

### Missing auth: gateway rejects before RPC execution.
# Expect HTTP401 and no room data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/get_room_snapshot
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"room_id":"{{roomId}}"}

### Stale version: after a successful mutation, an old expectedVersion returns 409.
# Expect HTTP409 {ok:false,messageKey:VERSION_CONFLICT}.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/set_ready
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"19000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":1,"ready":true}

### Join: 200, caller becomes a member with ready=false.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/join_room
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_join","code":"{{roomCode}}","display_name":"GM19 member"}

### Preferences: 200, own preferences only; resets readiness.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/update_preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_preferences","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}},"cuisine_ids":[],"category_ids":[],"temperature":"cold","flavor":null,"history_consent":false}

### Context: 200 for host in lobby; group readiness is reset.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/update_context
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_context","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}},"anchor_id":"{{anchorId}}","radius_m":1500,"desired_at":"{{desiredAt}}","service_mode":"dine_in","meal_slot":"dinner","time_hint":null,"budget":null,"avoid_recent":false}

### Ready: repeat for each member with a unique requestId and latest version.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/set_ready
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_ready_host","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}},"ready":true}

### Start: 200 ROUND_1 after at least two members are ready.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/start_round
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_start","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}}}

### Leave: 200 in lobby; 409 ROOM_LOCKED after start.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/leave_room
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_leave","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}}}

### Cancel: member confirms whole-session cancellation after start; 200 CANCELLED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/cancel_room
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"req_manual_cancel","room_id":"{{roomId}}","expected_version":{{version}},"confirm_cancel":true}
